OL,3,ABarclays workers ask for more money to
OL,4,Areturn to the office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Barclays staff are
OL,7,Fdemanding concessions from the bank,
OL,8,Fincluding a one-off payment, after it
OL,9,Fsaid it wants employees to work from
OL,10,Fthe office more often.
OL,12,FStaff who have been expected to work in
OL,13,Fthe office for two days per week should
OL,14,Fbe in the office for at least three
OL,15,Fdays a week from next month, according
OL,16,Fto the company.
OL,18,FUnite, which represents about 36,000
OL,19,FBarclays staff, is calling for the bank
OL,20,Fto reverse its decision. The union is
OL,21,Falso pressing for exemptions to offset
OL,22,Fincreased travel and childcare costs.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
